# test_data/ is fixtures for the test suite -- real DDS, .wem and .glb files a modder
# would import. They are megabytes each and no use to an installed copy, so they are
# excluded from the sdist. The wheel never had them: they live beside the package
# rather than inside it, so package discovery does not see them.
prune test_data
prune tests
exclude vendor_tools.py
